  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethnic Media Campaign</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Etnisk mediakampanj</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det federala jugoslaviska ministeriet f&#xF6;r nationella och etniska grupper skall genomf&#xF6;ra en kampanj i jugoslaviska medier f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka den etniska toleransen i FRY. Kampanjen &#xE4;r framf&#xF6;r allt riktad till serber f&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; dem att acceptera och leva tillsammans med landets minoriteter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Federal Yugoslav Ministry for National and Ethnic Communities will implement a media campaign in Yugoslav media in order to increase the ethnic tolerance in FRY. The campaing is primarily aimed at Serbs in order to make them accept and co-exist with the country&apos;s minorities.</narrative>
  </description>
